// Avdiivka, part III, Stepove in the snow (Степове в снігу): 11 January 2024, afternoon. A T-90M with a pair of
// BMPs and a section of infantry comes into the village's east end under smoke and fires on the trench; two
// Bradleys of the 47th take it on, the first pass fails, the second blinds it with 25 mm fire, the crew runs, and
// an FPV burns it (v02 §1, §6, §7). The schema is bav_core::data and bav_sim::data; the map is map.ron.
(
    date: "11 January 2024",
    tally_date: "11 JAN 2024",
    // 14:00 to about 16:05 in the day's 1500 s; sunset 15:56.
    day_start_min: 840.0,
    compression: 0.083,
    attacker: Ru,
    season: Winter,
    // 11 January is the 11th day of the year; Kyiv on UTC+2.
    sun: (11, 2.0),
    // The 47th flew thermal Mavics by then: key I.
    thermal: true,
    // Fictional, the 47th's: the player (a sighthound), the 55th's guns (anvil), the observers on the heap (crest),
    // the battalion's command post (flint).
    callsigns: (
        player: ("Khort", "Хорт"),
        guns: ("Kovadlo", "Ковадло"),
        op: ("Hrebin", "Гребінь"),
        command: ("Kremin", "Кремінь"),
    ),
    words: (
        briefing: r#"AVDIIVKA (АВДІЇВКА), THE NORTHERN SHOULDER
11 JANUARY 2024, AFTERNOON

Avdiivka has been a fortified salient since 2014, ten kilometres from Donetsk. Its northern anchor is the coke
plant; north of the plant stands its spoil heap, and beyond the heap the village of Stepove on the railway.
Open stubble fields run from both towards Krasnohorivka and Kamianka, where the Russians are.

You are with the 47th Mechanised Brigade (47-ма ОМБр), moved here from Zaporizhzhia with little time to rest:
a drone operator and a fire controller at Stepove. The 110th holds the heap. The 55th Artillery Brigade's guns
are behind you, and for once there are shells.

Three months of this. The October wrecks are under the snow. The Russians come at the village in small groups now,
a tank or two with them, and the field between the village and the railway is where they die.

This afternoon a T-90M is in the village's east end, firing on the trench.

The day will run whether or not you do anything. What you do matters at the margin.

Mouse: right-drag to look, wheel to zoom.  WASD: fly the drone.  Q/E: turn.  R/F: climb/descend.
Left click: 155 mm fire mission (4 rounds).  Shift+click: RAAM mines.  Ctrl+click: HIMARS.  4: an FPV.
Space: ATGM teams AUTO / HOLD / FREE.  1/2 or Tab: drone / the observers on the heap.  I: thermal.  P: pause.  [ ]: time.
M: move the drone team when they find you.  3: into a position with an ATGM team.  Right button: the sight.  Left click: launch.
6: into a Bradley's gunner's seat (again for the next).  Right button: the sight.  Left click: a burst.  X: AP / HE.  T: a TOW.

Press Enter."#,
        op_label: "OBSERVERS, THE HEAP'S FIRST TERRACE (СПОСТЕРІГАЧІ, ПЕРША ТЕРАСА ТЕРИКОНУ)",
        op_lost: "The observers on the heap are gone. No eyes from the height.",
        forward_belt: "the railway",
        plow_mine: "Mine under the plow. The lead tank's plow is gone, it keeps going.",
        mine_lines: [
            "Mine! He went off the track. That one's done.",
            "Another one. Tracks off.",
            "He drove right past the last one, same line. Mine.",
            "Boom. Mine. He's not moving.",
        ],
        registered: ("Я {guns}. Вогонь по пристріляній точці {n}.", "This is {guns}. Firing on registered point {n}."),
        closing: [
            "The 47th's video went round the world the next day: \"American equipment won.\"",
            "Avdiivka was given up on 17 February 2024, and Stepove on the 27th.",
        ],
        keys: "R: the same afternoon again, across the same field.     Esc: quit.",
        sources: [
            (
                publisher: "The War Zone",
                date: "12 Jan 2024",
                title: "Armor experts break down video of Ukrainian M2 Bradley mauling Russian T-90M tank",
                url: "https://www.twz.com/armor-experts-breakdown-video-of-ukrainian-m2-bradley-mauling-russian-t-90m-tank",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "The War Zone",
                date: "Jan 2024",
                title: "Video games helped Ukrainian Bradley gunner win duel with Russian T-90M tank",
                url: "https://www.twz.com/video-games-helped-ukrainian-bradley-gunner-win-duel-with-russian-t-90m-tank",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "Forbes",
                date: "28 Dec 2023",
                title: "In one massive tank battle outside Avdiivka, the Russians lost as many as 21 tanks",
                url: "https://www.forbes.com/sites/davidaxe/2023/12/28/in-one-massive-tank-battle-outside-avdiivka-the-russians-lost-as-many-as-21-tanks-the-ukrainians-lost-two/",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "FDD's Long War Journal",
                date: "Mar 2024",
                title: "Battle of Avdiivka: a preliminary analysis",
                url: "https://www.longwarjournal.org/archives/2024/03/battle-of-avdiivka-a-preliminary-analysis.php",
            ),
        ],
    ),

    // October's wrecks under the snow, where the two waves stopped.
    old_wrecks: [
        (At((1206.0, 1415.8)), -0.45),
        (At((1211.2, 1313.1)), 3.08),
        (At((1175.2, 1238.0)), 0.13),
